<title>CHILE: SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULT IN THE SPANISH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO, Spain 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Spanish Cup</p>
<p>fourth round, second leg match played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Compostela	2   Atletico Madrid	  3</p>
<p>(Atletico win 5-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Playing Wednesday:</p>
<p>Real Betis v Tenerife (2-0)</p>
<p>Celta Vigo v Lleida (II) (1-1)</p>
<p>Athletic Bilbao v Racing Santander (0-1)</p>
<p>Valencia v Las Palmas (2-0)</p>
<p>Espanyol v Deportivo Coruna (2-2)</p>
<p>Playing Thursday:</p>
<p>Real Madrid v Barcelona (2-3)</p>
<p>Extremadura v Rayo Vallecano (2-2)</p>
